---
description: Never add Cursor/cursoragent as co-author in git commits; human attribution only
alwaysApply: true
---

# Git commit messages

- **Do not** add `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>`, or **any** line containing `cursoragent@cursor.com`.
- **Do not** add `Co-authored-by` trailers for AI tools (Cursor, Copilot, chat agents) unless a maintainer **explicitly** asks for a one-off exception in that task.
- Use the **human** author for commits; this repository does not credit automated agents in history.

Optional local enforcement: `git config core.hooksPath .githooks` (see `.githooks/README`).
